WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.875
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.145 --> 00:09.025
‎SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
01:35.385 --> 01:39.025
ADAPTED FROM JIA JIN CHAI, ORIGINAL NOVEL BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

4
01:42.105 --> 01:46.025
XIANZHUANG

5
01:46.105 --> 01:48.105
DEEP CLOUDS, TWILIGHT SEAS

6
01:51.985 --> 01:54.065
Lady Shou'an, she's here.

7
01:58.505 --> 02:02.385
Child, come closer. Let me have a good look at you.

8
02:03.265 --> 02:04.305
Go on!

9
02:05.305 --> 02:06.665
Mind your manners!

10
02:08.265 --> 02:10.105
I told you again and again

11
02:10.185 --> 02:11.985
to bring her here nicely

12
02:12.065 --> 02:13.105
and do not frighten her!

13
02:17.225 --> 02:19.185
Lady Shou'an, you had me seized at midnight.

14
02:20.225 --> 02:21.225
What do you want from me?

15
02:25.745 --> 02:27.345
What a lovely young woman.

16
02:28.105 --> 02:30.465
Beautiful and poised.

17
02:30.545 --> 02:33.265
You are even more like my granddaughter than Rao.

18
02:34.385 --> 02:35.705
But, child,

19
02:35.785 --> 02:38.745
you're always on guard, always wary.

20
02:39.265 --> 02:41.665
It shows how frightened and uneasy you are.

21
02:41.745 --> 02:45.545
Do you really want to spend the rest of your life

22
02:45.625 --> 02:48.505
walking on eggshells like this?

23
02:48.585 --> 02:50.025
I asked you here today

24
02:50.105 --> 02:52.745
because I want to make you a deal.

25
02:55.465 --> 02:56.745
What kind of deal?

26
03:00.785 --> 03:02.785
You took a place that wasn't yours.

27
03:02.865 --> 03:04.665
How can you ever live in peace?

28
03:05.545 --> 03:07.705
If you're willing to step aside,

29
03:07.785 --> 03:10.185
the Zhou family will compensate you.

30
03:10.265 --> 03:11.465
Everyone knows

31
03:11.545 --> 03:14.865
my eldest daughter married into the Huo family in Jiangnan.

32
03:14.945 --> 03:19.265
Although the Huo family isn't as powerful as the Lu family,

33
03:19.345 --> 03:23.265
they still live in luxury and possess a vast fortune.

34
03:23.345 --> 03:24.385
Huo Jue.

35
03:28.545 --> 03:29.465
Grandmother.

36
03:31.465 --> 03:33.785
The Huo family is open-minded.

37
03:33.865 --> 03:35.625
they don't ask about birth or rank.

38
03:35.705 --> 03:38.545
They only want a smart, capable woman

39
03:38.625 --> 03:40.505
who can handle great responsibility.

40
03:40.585 --> 03:42.545
From now on, she will follow you

41
03:42.625 --> 03:44.385
and do business across the country.

42
03:44.465 --> 03:47.545
The perfect woman is right here. What do you think?

43
03:47.625 --> 03:49.705
I wouldn't dare go against your wishes.

44
03:49.785 --> 03:51.705
I shall abide entirely by Grandmother's decision.

45
03:52.785 --> 03:54.345
You heard him.

46
03:54.425 --> 03:57.465
Once you become Huo Jue's wife,

47
03:57.545 --> 04:00.385
your enemies will become your family.

48
04:01.105 --> 04:05.145
You won't have to fear being silencedñ or losing your life.

49
04:05.225 --> 04:08.105
As for the Lu family, I have my ways.

50
04:08.185 --> 04:11.105
Once you two secretly switch places,

51
04:11.625 --> 04:14.425
I'll keep Jundai out of sight.

52
04:14.985 --> 04:19.105
As time passes, no one will question you anymore.

53
04:19.705 --> 04:22.305
Then this will all be behind us.

54
04:27.305 --> 04:28.505
What are you laughing at?

55
04:29.665 --> 04:32.465
Grandmother is even offering marriage to put your mind at ease.

56
04:32.545 --> 04:34.465
Lu Zhuo may come from a powerful family,

57
04:34.545 --> 04:36.825
but the higher the stakes, the colder his heart.

58
04:37.465 --> 04:38.865
If he ever learns the truth,

59
04:39.625 --> 04:41.025
he'll feel utterly humiliated.

60
04:41.625 --> 04:44.305
He'll be the first one to kill you.

61
04:45.825 --> 04:48.025
The Huo family trades far and wide.

62
04:48.105 --> 04:49.665
Keeping our word matters above all.

63
04:49.745 --> 04:52.945
I've personally agreed to this marriage. I'll treat you well from now on.

64
04:53.705 --> 04:57.145
Come south with me and leave the capital. No one there will know your past.

65
04:57.745 --> 05:00.065
You'll be free, wealthy, and safe.

66
05:00.865 --> 05:02.385
Better than living on the edge, isn't it?

67
05:06.785 --> 05:10.465
If you insist on being stubborn, no one can save you.

68
05:12.625 --> 05:14.305
Thank you for your kindness, Lady Shou'an.

69
05:15.545 --> 05:16.825
How merciful of you to spare my life.

70
05:19.105 --> 05:22.185
As for marrying into the Huo family, I'm not worthy of such an honor.

71
05:22.265 --> 05:24.145
You insolent servant!

72
05:24.225 --> 05:26.985
I'm the Huo family's eldest son. You think I'm not good enough for you?

73
05:27.065 --> 05:29.225
Huo Jue, mind your manners.

74
05:31.025 --> 05:33.465
A lowborn woman may become a noble wife,

75
05:34.145 --> 05:36.385
then die of a sudden illness at home,

76
05:36.905 --> 05:39.065
or die giving birth,

77
05:40.185 --> 05:41.665
or accidentally drown,

78
05:42.185 --> 05:43.705
or fall from a horse and break her neck.

79
05:43.785 --> 05:46.905
There are many ways to make a death look natural.

80
05:46.985 --> 05:48.425
Once I leave the capital,

81
05:48.505 --> 05:51.025
wouldn't my life be entirely in my husband's hands?

82
05:51.745 --> 05:53.345
Who would seek justice for a woman all alone?

83
05:54.505 --> 05:55.905
Lady Shou'an's offer

84
05:56.425 --> 05:58.905
only trades an immediate death for a delayed one.

85
05:59.505 --> 06:01.025
One means dying now.

86
06:01.105 --> 06:02.665
The other means dying next fall.

87
06:02.745 --> 06:06.065
Threats didn't work, so now you're tempting me with rewards.

88
06:07.265 --> 06:08.865
You even used your own grandson as bait.

89
06:09.705 --> 06:11.105
Lady Shou'an, you certainly bet big.

90
06:11.745 --> 06:14.625
You! You think too poorly of us!

91
06:14.705 --> 06:15.705
Who's trying to hurt you?

92
06:16.785 --> 06:20.185
Mother, I told you long ago.

93
06:20.705 --> 06:23.665
This woman is greedy, cunning, and impossible to reason with.

94
06:24.185 --> 06:26.865
-Why waste your breath on her? -Aunt.

95
06:27.465 --> 06:29.625
Mother, you're far too softhearted.

96
06:29.705 --> 06:32.185
Let me handle this.

97
06:44.785 --> 06:47.185
Who in the world would've imagined

98
06:47.265 --> 06:49.145
a lowly night-soil woman

99
06:49.665 --> 06:51.985
would dare impersonate my daughter?

100
06:52.505 --> 06:55.625
Such outrageous nerve!

101
06:56.145 --> 06:59.185
A-Chou, I'll give you one last chance.

102
06:59.945 --> 07:03.705
Kneel, beg forgiveness, and repent for what you've done.

103
07:04.225 --> 07:05.745
Then I'll spare your life.

104
07:06.745 --> 07:08.105
Did you hear me?

105
07:08.185 --> 07:09.545
Kneel before Lady Li and admit your wrongs!

106
07:10.425 --> 07:11.425
Wrongs?

107
07:12.905 --> 07:15.025
Your daughter was the one

108
07:15.105 --> 07:17.905
who made me take her place and tried to kill me time and again.

109
07:18.865 --> 07:20.305
What did I do wrong?

110
07:22.185 --> 07:25.545
The high and low have always had their proper place.

111
07:26.385 --> 07:28.745
You're nothing but a drab little sparrow,

112
07:29.425 --> 07:33.345
yet you keep trying to force your way into a phoenix's nest.

113
07:33.865 --> 07:36.505
You've schemed and stopped at nothing.

114
07:37.665 --> 07:41.465
You are simply too greedy.

115
07:41.545 --> 07:45.105
Nothing could ever satisfy you. That's why you've ended up here.

116
07:45.705 --> 07:48.345
Yet you still dare claim you've done nothing wrong.

117
07:49.185 --> 07:51.265
If I say you're wrong, then you're wrong.

118
07:51.905 --> 07:53.385
Don't you dare talk back to me again!

119
07:56.505 --> 07:58.185
How ridiculous.

120
07:59.185 --> 08:01.665
Wasn't Lady Li a wet nurse's daughter too?

121
08:02.705 --> 08:03.545
Slap her!

122
08:05.465 --> 08:06.305
Aunt.

123
08:06.385 --> 08:07.865
Don't lower yourself by arguing with an ill-mannered lowborn girl.

124
08:14.385 --> 08:17.105
I did nothing wrong.

125
08:17.705 --> 08:20.265
Child, why put yourself through this?

126
08:20.865 --> 08:22.305
Defying Lady Li is punishable by death!

127
08:22.985 --> 08:25.305
Do you truly want to die? Apologize now!

128
08:25.385 --> 08:27.105
What makes something right or wrong?

129
08:27.185 --> 08:29.505
The world isn't that simple.

130
08:30.145 --> 08:33.024
When it's cold and rainy, you fear the silkworms will freeze.

131
08:33.105 --> 08:36.305
When the sun shines bright, you fear the crops will dry out.

132
08:37.105 --> 08:40.065
Clouds harm the silkworms.

133
08:40.144 --> 08:42.465
Sunshine can hurt the crops even more.

134
08:43.345 --> 08:44.865
Even heaven can't always please the farmers.

135
08:44.945 --> 08:46.585
I'm only human.

136
08:48.545 --> 08:50.465
I just want to survive.

137
08:51.265 --> 08:52.625
I just want to live with dignity.

138
08:53.825 --> 08:57.145
As long as I haven't broken the law or killed anyone or set fires,

139
08:57.225 --> 08:59.185
I've done nothing that weighs on my conscience!

140
08:59.265 --> 09:01.745
So what I've done, what right do you have to call it wrong?

141
09:01.825 --> 09:04.025
Silence! I said silence! Do you hear me?

142
09:04.105 --> 09:05.105
No!

143
09:07.785 --> 09:10.705
Should I grovel before you and beg forgiveness?

144
09:12.145 --> 09:13.705
Would you really spare my life then?

145
09:15.145 --> 09:18.425
Since you wouldn't, why should I humiliate myself?

146
09:19.505 --> 09:20.465
In this life,

147
09:21.065 --> 09:23.985
I've knelt and begged more than enough.

148
09:32.345 --> 09:34.265
-You… -Bring it in.

149
09:50.225 --> 09:51.305
You have two choices.

150
09:51.385 --> 09:54.265
Leave the capital with Huo Jue,

151
09:55.065 --> 09:57.025
and never return for the rest of your life.

152
09:57.625 --> 10:00.505
Or I'll have you boiled alive.

153
10:01.025 --> 10:02.705
Then this ends with your death.

154
10:03.545 --> 10:05.545
I won't pursue your crime of posing as a noblewoman,

155
10:06.305 --> 10:08.705
nor will I arrest or punish your family.

156
10:10.425 --> 10:11.665
You decide.

157
10:16.905 --> 10:18.785
EARL OF CHENG'AN'S RESIDENCE

158
10:18.865 --> 10:20.825
Mother, you're still in the mood to tend flowers?

159
10:21.425 --> 10:23.505
The hibiscus you planted in the courtyard

160
10:23.585 --> 10:26.265
was completely ruined by those women in Father's study.

161
10:27.185 --> 10:28.425
Really?

162
10:29.185 --> 10:30.385
Mother!

163
10:33.505 --> 10:35.385
Grandmother kept Father in line before,

164
10:35.465 --> 10:36.625
so he didn't dare behave so shamelessly.

165
10:37.585 --> 10:39.985
But since her eye trouble left her confined indoors,

166
10:40.065 --> 10:41.385
he's become even more muddleheaded.

167
10:42.785 --> 10:45.865
Those flirtatious maids in the courtyard were bad enough.

168
10:45.945 --> 10:49.385
Last month, he even brought in two singers through the side gate.

169
10:49.465 --> 10:51.305
The whole household is in chaos.

170
10:53.945 --> 10:55.585
Children shouldn't speak ill of their father.

171
10:56.105 --> 10:59.185
Your father's affairs are no concern of yours.

172
11:00.185 --> 11:03.945
Look. Two flowers blooming on one branch.

173
11:04.025 --> 11:04.945
How lovely.

174
11:07.265 --> 11:08.225
There.

175
11:08.745 --> 11:10.505
I'll put it right here.

176
11:10.585 --> 11:13.825
Mother never seems to care about anything concerning Father.

177
11:13.905 --> 11:15.785
I truly don't understand.

178
11:15.865 --> 11:19.145
But you seem so happy today, Mother.

179
11:19.225 --> 11:20.825
Is there some good news?

180
11:22.785 --> 11:24.145
The best news ever.

181
11:37.705 --> 11:39.025
Lu Zhuo.

182
11:39.105 --> 11:40.465
I was just coming to find you!

183
11:40.545 --> 11:41.825
Something happened. Wei Rao…

184
11:41.905 --> 11:42.745
I know.

185
11:43.905 --> 11:45.145
Wait for me.

186
11:57.545 --> 11:59.785
I thought you had more nerve than this.

187
11:59.865 --> 12:00.985
Turns out you're nothing special.

188
12:02.305 --> 12:05.905
I hear your real father was a shameless gambler.

189
12:05.985 --> 12:07.545
Like father, like daughter.

190
12:07.625 --> 12:09.505
Dragons breed dragons, phoenixes breed phoenixes.

191
12:09.585 --> 12:11.345
Eagles soar, while rats burrow.

192
12:12.465 --> 12:15.625
Fine clothes and precious jewels

193
12:15.705 --> 12:18.425
can't hide the greed in your blood.

194
12:21.305 --> 12:23.065
It's already dawn.

195
12:23.145 --> 12:24.985
What are you still stalling for?

196
12:25.065 --> 12:28.025
Admit your guilt and surrender. I'll spare your life.

197
12:34.745 --> 12:36.505
My aunt always keeps her word.

198
12:36.585 --> 12:39.385
No one in this house dares defy her. Bow your head and confess!

199
12:41.745 --> 12:43.345
Don't you value your life above all?

200
12:44.025 --> 12:45.625
Even if you only delay your death till fall,

201
12:45.705 --> 12:46.905
at least you'll survive today.

202
12:46.985 --> 12:49.425
I only wanted to see

203
12:49.505 --> 12:52.385
how far a little sparrow like me could go, how high I could fly.

204
12:52.465 --> 12:54.825
Too bad I'll never get the chance.

205
12:55.465 --> 12:56.785
I've done nothing wrong.

206
12:57.745 --> 13:00.065
Kill me however you please.

207
13:00.745 --> 13:03.065
What a stubborn girl.

208
13:03.585 --> 13:05.425
Even now, you still refuse to give up.

209
13:06.425 --> 13:09.905
Or do you really think I won't kill you?

210
13:14.425 --> 13:15.705
Then boil me alive.

211
13:17.145 --> 13:18.665
A-Chou!

212
13:25.185 --> 13:26.545
Lady Li, Lord Lu is here.

213
13:28.385 --> 13:29.825
Perfect timing.

214
13:30.665 --> 13:33.985
He came here himself. That saves me a great deal of trouble.

215
13:34.585 --> 13:39.265
Let's see whether the Lu family really dares oppose me openly.

216
13:39.865 --> 13:41.505
Make her see sense!

217
13:44.705 --> 13:47.385
What are you doing? Let me go! Let me go!

218
13:47.465 --> 13:49.265
What are you doing?

219
14:07.625 --> 14:08.705
Lu Zhuo greets Your Ladyship.

220
14:09.305 --> 14:11.105
You seem to be in quite a hurry, Lord Lu.

221
14:11.185 --> 14:12.465
Where are you rushing off to?

222
14:12.545 --> 14:15.625
I heard Your Ladyship invited Wei Rao here for a visit.

223
14:15.705 --> 14:16.665
I shouldn't have disturbed you,

224
14:16.745 --> 14:19.425
but she's Grandmother's favorite granddaughter-in-law.

225
14:20.305 --> 14:23.625
Grandmother kept asking after her, so I came to take her home.

226
14:24.465 --> 14:26.505
I invited my own daughter here for a reunion.

227
14:26.585 --> 14:27.745
What's the rush?

228
14:29.305 --> 14:32.465
You really are newlyweds, so deeply devoted

229
14:32.545 --> 14:34.465
you can't bear to be apart for even a moment.

230
14:35.625 --> 14:37.185
Rao, come here.

231
14:37.905 --> 14:39.545
Your husband is here to take you home.

232
15:14.025 --> 15:16.385
Your Ladyship, what is the meaning of this?

233
15:21.025 --> 15:24.625
My late husband and I were once deeply in love.

234
15:25.345 --> 15:27.985
We thought we'd grow old together.

235
15:28.705 --> 15:30.305
But fate had other plans.

236
15:30.985 --> 15:33.225
A great battle broke out beyond Qiyang Pass.

237
15:33.305 --> 15:34.385
I lost my husband.

238
15:35.345 --> 15:37.705
Rao lost the father who loved her most.

239
15:38.385 --> 15:40.465
My husband died saving your father.

240
15:41.185 --> 15:43.545
So the old duke made a vow.

241
15:44.065 --> 15:46.065
One day, his heir would marry Rao

242
15:47.145 --> 15:49.585
to make up for her losing her father so young

243
15:50.105 --> 15:52.545
and repay what the Lu family owed the Wei family.

244
15:53.705 --> 15:56.985
We both know exactly who's inside that room.

245
15:58.905 --> 15:59.985
Lu Zhuo.

246
16:00.705 --> 16:03.665
My husband and I had only this one daughter.

247
16:04.385 --> 16:05.905
She was the treasure of our lives.

248
16:06.585 --> 16:10.065
And now, I'm placing her in your hands myself.

249
16:10.145 --> 16:11.985
Treat her well.

250
16:12.065 --> 16:14.145
I used to be spoiled and willful.

251
16:14.745 --> 16:16.225
My foolishness caused many trouble.

252
16:17.145 --> 16:19.225
Mother gave me a stern lesson last night.

253
16:19.825 --> 16:21.225
I deeply regret what I've done.

254
16:22.785 --> 16:23.825
From now on,

255
16:24.425 --> 16:26.185
I'll control my temper

256
16:26.745 --> 16:28.665
and be a proper, virtuous principal wife.

257
16:29.385 --> 16:32.265
My Lord, you're generous and forgiving.

258
16:32.945 --> 16:36.065
Please let go of the past and forgive me.

259
16:43.545 --> 16:46.185
Even pure gold has flaws. So does fine jade.

260
16:46.265 --> 16:47.745
No one is perfect.

261
16:48.345 --> 16:49.705
Rao grew up without proper guidance.

262
16:49.785 --> 16:52.025
So naturally, she became somewhat spoiled.

263
16:52.105 --> 16:54.185
From now on, I'll keep people by her side

264
16:54.265 --> 16:56.265
to guide and correct her at all times.

265
16:56.345 --> 16:58.665
She won't cause trouble again.

266
16:58.745 --> 17:00.865
She'll become a proper principal wife.

267
17:00.945 --> 17:04.704
The past is gone. What matters is what comes next.

268
17:04.785 --> 17:06.785
Now take your wife home.

269
17:07.305 --> 17:08.985
Live in harmony from now on.

270
17:09.665 --> 17:11.625
You can still make a fine couple.

271
17:33.225 --> 17:34.425
My Lord.

272
17:35.265 --> 17:36.425
Lu Zhuo.

273
17:36.505 --> 17:39.105
I know you're a man of honor who keeps his word.

274
17:39.705 --> 17:42.705
You would never break your promise or cast aside what is right.

275
17:43.745 --> 17:44.945
Isn't that so?

276
17:45.025 --> 17:47.905
My Lu family kept the promise and came for the bride.

277
17:49.625 --> 17:52.185
But did the Wei family keep yours?

278
17:53.345 --> 17:54.985
You broke faith first.

279
17:55.665 --> 17:57.345
You refused to board the wedding carriage.

280
17:57.425 --> 18:00.225
So don't dream of another chance in this life!

281
18:02.265 --> 18:03.585
Lu Zhuo!

282
18:05.105 --> 18:06.705
I used to be awful,

283
18:07.705 --> 18:10.305
but only because my parents weren't there to teach me.

284
18:10.385 --> 18:12.505
I never saw Father from the time I could remember.

285
18:12.585 --> 18:14.505
Mother couldn't stay by my side either.

286
18:15.025 --> 18:16.185
Who was there to truly guide me?

287
18:16.785 --> 18:18.665
I wasn't born this cruel.

288
18:18.745 --> 18:21.465
You hate how vicious and overbearing I am. I'll change.

289
18:21.545 --> 18:23.945
I swear I'll turn over a new leaf from this day on.

290
18:24.025 --> 18:27.865
I'll never harm the innocent again. I won't do anything you dislike again.

291
18:28.465 --> 18:31.665
Lu Zhuo, I'm not ordering you.

292
18:32.225 --> 18:35.745
Just take this as a mother's plea.

293
18:40.465 --> 18:41.305
Lu Zhuo!

294
18:43.025 --> 18:44.745
Mother, stop him!

295
18:44.825 --> 18:47.705
-Stop him! -Lu Zhuo, how dare you!

296
18:50.265 --> 18:51.305
Stop!

297
18:54.025 --> 18:55.265
Move!

298
18:58.385 --> 18:59.625
Careful.

299
19:10.945 --> 19:13.225
Lord Lu! Lord Lu!

300
19:13.305 --> 19:14.665
You can't take this woman!

301
19:15.665 --> 19:16.665
She's an impostor.

302
19:16.745 --> 19:18.385
She's been deceiving everyone.

303
19:18.465 --> 19:19.665
Move.

304
19:20.185 --> 19:22.265
You've seen the real Wei Rao with your own eyes.

305
19:22.345 --> 19:25.385
Your wife is standing right in front of you,

306
19:25.465 --> 19:26.425
yet you refuse to even look at her.

307
19:27.025 --> 19:28.185
Instead, you're holding that woman.

308
19:28.785 --> 19:29.945
Have you lost your mind?

309
19:30.585 --> 19:32.745
When I was gravely ill and near death,

310
19:35.505 --> 19:38.625
she came here in the wedding carriage for the lucky marriage.

311
19:39.505 --> 19:42.425
She married me and joined me in honoring our ancestors.

312
19:43.265 --> 19:45.145
She is my lawful wife.

313
19:45.785 --> 19:48.865
As for anyone else, they have nothing to do with me.

314
19:49.905 --> 19:51.505
You heard him, Mother.

315
19:51.585 --> 19:53.385
It's not that I refused to humble myself.

316
19:54.105 --> 19:55.905
That temptress has completely bewitched him.

317
19:55.985 --> 19:57.905
He doesn't care for me at all.

318
19:57.985 --> 19:59.665
I'm the noble daughter of an earl's house,

319
19:59.745 --> 20:00.825
Lady Li's own daughter,

320
20:00.905 --> 20:03.265
yet I'm worth less to him than a lowly night-soil woman!

321
20:03.785 --> 20:06.385
Mother, Lu Zhuo has humiliated me like this,

322
20:07.185 --> 20:09.065
and you still won't stand up for me?

323
20:09.145 --> 20:11.145
I'll hang myself with a rope later!

324
20:11.225 --> 20:13.785
Better that than live in shame for the rest of my life.

325
20:16.465 --> 20:17.385
Lu Zhuo.

326
20:18.025 --> 20:20.145
I tried to reason with you politely

327
20:20.905 --> 20:22.505
to preserve both families' dignity

328
20:23.465 --> 20:25.385
and protect your loyal family's good name.

329
20:25.905 --> 20:30.465
But if you truly anger me, I'll take this before His Majesty.

330
20:30.545 --> 20:32.705
Can the Lu family bear the consequences?

331
20:33.305 --> 20:36.065
Lady Li, is that a threat?

332
20:36.665 --> 20:40.225
Call it a threat or a kind suggestion.

333
20:40.825 --> 20:43.505
I don't care how powerful the Lu family is

334
20:43.585 --> 20:45.825
or how many victories you've won, Lu Zhuo.

335
20:45.905 --> 20:48.225
If you dare humiliate my daughter,

336
20:48.745 --> 20:51.265
I'll make you pay a thousandfold.

337
20:52.145 --> 20:55.705
This woman is an impostor and a murderer.

338
20:55.785 --> 20:58.385
Without my permission, no one can take her away!

339
20:59.265 --> 21:00.905
Quite the show of power, Lady Li.

340
21:01.505 --> 21:04.425
The Lu family's title was earned through real victories.

341
21:04.945 --> 21:07.665
Every honor we gained was paid for in blood.

342
21:08.505 --> 21:10.465
We won't be ruled by a woman of the inner court.

343
21:11.665 --> 21:12.865
Zhao Song.

344
21:19.025 --> 21:22.105
My wife, Lady Wei, freed tenant farmers and aided refugees.

345
21:22.185 --> 21:24.465
She helps the poor and those in need.

346
21:24.985 --> 21:26.825
Everyone in the capital praises her.

347
21:26.905 --> 21:28.425
A petition from the people was presented to His Majesty.

348
21:28.505 --> 21:30.065
His Majesty was greatly pleased.

349
21:31.705 --> 21:35.305
He issued a special decree granting her the title of Noble Lady.

350
21:36.545 --> 21:37.385
Her title is

351
21:38.705 --> 21:39.825
Wu'an.

352
21:41.505 --> 21:44.385
A Noble Lady? His Majesty made her a Noble Lady?

353
21:45.185 --> 21:47.785
Impossible! A woman of such low birth

354
21:48.345 --> 21:50.585
can't hold the same rank as a prince's daughter!

355
21:50.665 --> 21:52.105
Lu Zhuo, you deserve death!

356
21:53.625 --> 21:54.505
For her,

357
21:55.145 --> 21:57.065
you actually petitioned His Majesty for a title?

358
21:57.825 --> 21:58.825
Now,

359
21:59.785 --> 22:01.185
I'm here to take my wife,

360
22:04.385 --> 22:06.545
Noble Lady Wu'an, home.

361
22:09.745 --> 22:11.345
Who still dares stop me?

362
22:13.465 --> 22:14.665
Zhao Song, ready the horses!

363
22:16.825 --> 22:18.785
-You! -Make way!

364
22:19.545 --> 22:21.745
No! She can't leave!

365
22:21.825 --> 22:23.705
Mother, you promised to stand up for me!

366
22:23.785 --> 22:26.745
Kill her for me! Then Lu Zhuo must die too!

367
22:26.825 --> 22:29.105
-Mother! Mother! -Look at yourself!

368
22:29.185 --> 22:30.185
Take her away!

369
22:30.265 --> 22:33.145
Mother! Mother!

370
22:33.225 --> 22:34.985
Mother!

371
22:35.505 --> 22:36.945
Wretch!

372
22:45.345 --> 22:47.225
-Were you burned? -Grandmother.

373
22:47.305 --> 22:49.185
I thought we could use Aunt's authority today

374
22:49.825 --> 22:51.225
to force Lu Zhuo to take Jundai instead.

375
22:51.305 --> 22:52.625
But he actually secured a title for that woman.

376
22:53.305 --> 22:54.905
What do we do now?

377
23:07.985 --> 23:08.945
Are you all right?

378
23:16.785 --> 23:19.185
XIANZHUANG

379
23:25.465 --> 23:28.305
Easy. I won't let you fall.

380
23:29.585 --> 23:30.785
Thank you.

381
23:33.585 --> 23:34.625
You worthless fool!

382
23:34.705 --> 23:37.425
After all I've done fighting for you, you tossed me aside now!

383
23:37.505 --> 23:38.865
Any conscience at all?

384
23:44.465 --> 23:45.865
Her Ladyship is back.

385
23:47.505 --> 23:48.505
My Lord.

386
23:51.825 --> 23:53.305
I have something to tell you.

387
23:53.985 --> 23:57.145
If you didn't say it before, then don't say it now.

388
23:58.585 --> 23:59.425
Go back and tend to your wound.

389
24:19.505 --> 24:21.745
It's fine. Don't worry.

390
24:22.265 --> 24:25.105
After soaking it in cold water, some medicine will take care of it.

391
24:25.945 --> 24:27.785
How did you get hurt this badly?

392
24:32.345 --> 24:33.265
You…

393
24:33.345 --> 24:34.865
DEEP CLOUDS, TWILIGHT SEAS

394
24:34.945 --> 24:35.785
Wait.

395
24:37.345 --> 24:38.505
I'll do it myself.

396
24:50.665 --> 24:51.905
Were you burned?

397
24:55.345 --> 24:58.145
Getting out safely always comes at a price.

398
24:58.745 --> 25:00.865
That must hurt so much…

399
25:02.425 --> 25:03.785
It's nothing.

400
25:03.865 --> 25:06.505
Back when I worked for a living, I suffered far worse injuries.

401
25:06.585 --> 25:07.585
This is nothing.

402
25:08.585 --> 25:09.945
It doesn't hurt at all.

403
25:14.785 --> 25:16.785
It has to hurt. Don't pretend it doesn't.

404
25:16.865 --> 25:18.745
Look at you…

405
25:22.425 --> 25:24.745
-Fool. -Let me see.

406
25:24.825 --> 25:26.225
I'm really fine.

407
25:29.225 --> 25:30.945
Get out of here!

408
25:44.905 --> 25:47.345
-Master, spare me… -Why are you crying?

409
25:48.465 --> 25:50.145
Stop those tears!

410
25:50.225 --> 25:52.465
Make a sound,

411
25:52.545 --> 25:54.865
and I'll beat you to death.

412
26:02.185 --> 26:04.465
You worthless trash.

413
26:05.505 --> 26:06.865
How dare you insult me?

414
26:07.505 --> 26:09.545
Sooner or later, I'll tear you to pieces!

415
26:12.065 --> 26:12.825
Rao.

416
26:16.665 --> 26:18.065
Clean this up.

417
26:31.145 --> 26:31.985
Mother.

418
26:35.905 --> 26:36.985
Leave us.

419
26:47.385 --> 26:48.225
Remember this.

420
26:48.305 --> 26:51.345
No matter what happens, never let your emotions show.

421
26:52.105 --> 26:55.265
If servants see you lose your temper, they'll see right through you.

422
26:55.865 --> 26:57.905
Who would truly fear a master

423
26:57.985 --> 26:59.865
who's fierce outside but weak within?

424
26:59.945 --> 27:02.145
Especially those who serve you day and night.

425
27:02.225 --> 27:04.305
You must treat them even better from now on.

426
27:04.825 --> 27:06.505
Cruelty will only bring trouble later.

427
27:08.625 --> 27:09.465
Mother.

428
27:10.505 --> 27:13.105
You know how badly I've been wronged.

429
27:13.985 --> 27:16.625
I lost my temper. I know I was wrong.

430
27:18.225 --> 27:21.825
Now Grandmother despises me, and the Lu family has cast me aside.

431
27:22.345 --> 27:23.625
If Father were still alive,

432
27:24.665 --> 27:26.865
someone would storm the Lu Residence for me

433
27:26.945 --> 27:28.505
and demand justice.

434
27:28.585 --> 27:30.905
But now I have no one to rely on.

435
27:32.385 --> 27:33.745
Except you, Mother,

436
27:35.305 --> 27:37.825
there's no one else in this world I can turn to…

437
27:42.225 --> 27:43.385
Don't be afraid.

438
27:46.785 --> 27:49.025
I'll always stand behind you.

439
27:51.265 --> 27:52.105
Don't worry.

440
28:04.945 --> 28:07.465
What about your legs? Were your legs burned worse?

441
28:07.545 --> 28:08.385
Lift your robe. Let me see.

442
28:08.465 --> 28:10.865
I'm your own grandmother. There's nothing to be shy about.

443
28:10.945 --> 28:13.945
They're really just burns. They only look frightening.

444
28:14.665 --> 28:15.785
You…

445
28:16.905 --> 28:19.305
Mother. It's all that girl's fault.

446
28:19.385 --> 28:21.105
She's far too vicious.

447
28:23.225 --> 28:24.345
Sit.

448
28:26.105 --> 28:27.145
Sit down.

449
28:27.665 --> 28:30.065
We're family. No need for formalities.

450
28:31.945 --> 28:34.785
We agreed before that we'd only frighten her

451
28:34.865 --> 28:37.785
and make her leave the capital with Huo Jue without a fuss.

452
28:37.865 --> 28:41.025
As long as she never came back, and we appeased the Lu family,

453
28:41.105 --> 28:43.225
the matter would've ended peacefully.

454
28:43.305 --> 28:46.985
Why make things more complicated and let them spiral out of control?

455
28:59.945 --> 29:02.185
You… You lied to me?

456
29:02.985 --> 29:03.985
Don't tell me

457
29:06.065 --> 29:09.425
you really planned to lure that girl out of the capital

458
29:09.505 --> 29:13.345
and secretly get rid of her?

459
29:13.905 --> 29:14.825
Mother.

460
29:15.785 --> 29:18.225
I've never killed the innocent.

461
29:18.305 --> 29:19.385
That woman called A-Chou

462
29:20.225 --> 29:22.385
is a condemned prisoner.

463
29:22.465 --> 29:24.305
She's a murderer.

464
29:24.985 --> 29:27.345
I'm only sending her where she belongs.

465
29:27.425 --> 29:28.505
What's wrong with that?

466
29:32.465 --> 29:33.505
Grandmother.

467
29:37.265 --> 29:40.545
Zhou… Zhou Fu. You've changed.

468
29:42.945 --> 29:45.945
You're still injured. Go get some rest.

469
29:55.385 --> 30:00.025
DEEP CLOUDS, TWILIGHT SEAS

470
30:03.585 --> 30:05.185
Fu…

471
30:05.825 --> 30:09.145
You were once so proud and honorable.

472
30:10.225 --> 30:12.865
Cold on the outside, soft at heart.

473
30:12.945 --> 30:16.665
You couldn't even bear to harm a blade of grass.

474
30:17.185 --> 30:18.785
But ever since you entered the palace,

475
30:19.665 --> 30:22.425
your face isn't the only thing that's grown cold. Your heart has too.

476
30:23.145 --> 30:25.025
That's a human life.

477
30:25.105 --> 30:27.945
How could you…just have her killed?

478
30:36.985 --> 30:38.825
Mother, think about it.

479
30:39.345 --> 30:41.585
Think about where I went.

480
30:42.385 --> 30:43.945
I had to fight to survive.

481
30:45.825 --> 30:47.865
All the hardships I faced…

482
30:50.825 --> 30:53.225
The palace is strict, with eyes everywhere.

483
30:54.145 --> 30:58.185
I used your illness as an excuse just to spend a few days with you.

484
30:58.865 --> 31:01.105
You should understand how hard things are for me.

485
31:03.905 --> 31:05.785
As for that woman called A-Chou,

486
31:06.465 --> 31:10.345
she may mean no harm, but that doesn't mean she won't hurt us.

487
31:10.865 --> 31:13.025
As long as she's living as Wei Rao,

488
31:13.105 --> 31:15.905
she and Rao can never coexist.

489
31:17.265 --> 31:19.025
Would you really sacrifice your own granddaughter

490
31:19.705 --> 31:22.025
for an outsider?

491
31:32.705 --> 31:36.065
Didn't you notice that girl

492
31:36.585 --> 31:38.465
reminds me of someone?

493
31:39.105 --> 31:39.945
What are you saying?

494
31:42.425 --> 31:46.785
Back then, someone knelt right here in this hall,

495
31:47.545 --> 31:49.105
just as defiant,

496
31:50.345 --> 31:52.265
questioning me again and again.

497
31:52.345 --> 31:53.865
I still remember it

498
31:53.945 --> 31:57.025
as clearly as if it happened yesterday.

499
31:57.745 --> 32:00.505
How could you have forgotten?

500
32:01.945 --> 32:04.105
I'm not saying you can't remarry.

501
32:04.185 --> 32:06.545
The capital is full of talented men.

502
32:06.625 --> 32:10.145
You can choose any of them,

503
32:10.225 --> 32:11.585
and I'll give you my blessing.

504
32:11.665 --> 32:14.265
But you mustn't marry into that gilded cage.

505
32:14.345 --> 32:15.825
Have you lost your senses?

506
32:15.905 --> 32:16.865
I want to be Empress!

507
32:17.985 --> 32:18.825
What did you say?

508
32:19.425 --> 32:22.465
They used to call me a wet nurse's daughter,

509
32:22.545 --> 32:24.705
too lowborn to be Empress.

510
32:25.305 --> 32:28.545
Now they call me an unfaithful widow,

511
32:28.625 --> 32:30.585
too immoral to be Empress.

512
32:31.265 --> 32:32.945
My husband died,

513
32:33.025 --> 32:36.065
and they openly and secretly bullied me and my fatherless child.

514
32:36.145 --> 32:38.465
They wanted me broken, crying every day.

515
32:39.585 --> 32:40.745
They can dream!

516
32:41.785 --> 32:43.385
The more they say I don't deserve it,

517
32:43.465 --> 32:44.745
the more I'm going to be Empress.

518
32:44.825 --> 32:47.825
Just watch, Mother. I'm going into the palace

519
32:47.905 --> 32:50.945
to carve out a place in this world for myself and my daughter!

520
32:55.065 --> 32:56.185
Zhou Fu!

521
33:03.985 --> 33:05.545
Mother, are you confused?

522
33:06.145 --> 33:08.185
How can you compare me to a murderer?

523
33:08.265 --> 33:11.025
That's not what I meant. I just… I…

524
33:17.425 --> 33:18.385
Impossible.

525
33:19.225 --> 33:20.065
It can't be.

526
33:21.865 --> 33:23.785
Then just say I've lost my senses.

527
33:26.865 --> 33:28.665
Mother, don't be too softhearted.

528
33:29.385 --> 33:31.265
I brought her here today

529
33:31.785 --> 33:33.585
and you used your authority to pressure her.

530
33:34.185 --> 33:36.865
But she wasn't the only one I wanted to test.

531
33:37.505 --> 33:40.945
I also wanted to test Lu Zhuo's intentions.

532
33:41.785 --> 33:43.665
If he'd agreed to my request,

533
33:43.745 --> 33:47.385
forgiven Rao, and taken her home at once,

534
33:47.465 --> 33:49.265
there'd still be room to fix this.

535
33:50.425 --> 33:51.785
But instead,

536
33:52.385 --> 33:54.065
his heart was hard as iron.

537
33:54.985 --> 33:56.865
So A-Chou absolutely

538
33:58.225 --> 33:59.825
cannot be allowed to live.

539
34:44.465 --> 34:46.065
My Lord, you saved my life.

540
34:46.945 --> 34:48.705
I don't know how I can ever repay you.

541
35:07.625 --> 35:09.505
Did you really need me to save you?

542
35:11.745 --> 35:13.265
Why would you say that, My Lord?

543
35:13.345 --> 35:15.185
I was trapped with no way out.

544
35:15.945 --> 35:18.105
If you hadn't arrived in time,

545
35:19.185 --> 35:22.825
I'd have been boiled alive and reduced to a pile of flesh.

546
35:23.425 --> 35:25.265
You've shown me such great kindness.

547
35:26.785 --> 35:28.385
I'm deeply grateful.

548
35:29.665 --> 35:32.865
Even a lifetime of devotion could never repay you.

549
35:37.985 --> 35:39.145
Liar.

550
35:41.105 --> 35:42.945
His Majesty always rewards merit fairly.

551
35:44.145 --> 35:46.665
Worthy men from the countryside can receive fine appointments.

552
35:47.665 --> 35:50.025
You tore up those contracts on the city tower,

553
35:50.105 --> 35:51.545
then won the people's hearts by helping those in need.

554
35:52.425 --> 35:53.945
Everyone praises your kindness and generosity.

555
35:54.025 --> 35:55.265
His Majesty

556
35:56.585 --> 35:57.945
would never leave such merit unrewarded.

557
35:59.585 --> 36:00.785
But that wasn't enough for you.

558
36:00.865 --> 36:04.025
You even brought Qi Zhongkai and Han Liao as witnesses.

559
36:05.505 --> 36:06.625
What do you mean?

560
36:08.825 --> 36:10.225
You know exactly what I mean.

561
36:11.985 --> 36:13.385
Qi Zhongkai is obvious enough.

562
36:14.625 --> 36:16.385
He loses his head whenever he sees you.

563
36:17.985 --> 36:20.625
Everyone knows the Empress Dowager despises Lady Li.

564
36:20.705 --> 36:22.105
They've been enemies for years.

565
36:22.705 --> 36:25.705
And Han Liao is kin to the Empress Dowager.

566
36:25.785 --> 36:26.945
He's been watching you closely.

567
36:28.505 --> 36:30.185
If you'd truly died at Xianzhuang,

568
36:30.705 --> 36:33.065
the Empress Dowager could've used it against Lady Li.

569
36:33.145 --> 36:34.425
The entire Zhou family

570
36:35.385 --> 36:36.545
would've been dragged into it.

571
36:38.105 --> 36:40.065
Unless Lady Li is truly a fool,

572
36:40.785 --> 36:42.425
she'd never kill anyone at Xianzhuang.

573
36:43.425 --> 36:44.825
She was only trying to scare you.

574
36:47.945 --> 36:50.545
I truly pitied those refugees.

575
36:53.305 --> 36:56.105
But you, My Lord, suspect everything.

576
36:58.305 --> 37:00.585
So why did you still seek an imperial decree?

577
37:03.425 --> 37:07.945
Why not let them take me, sell me off somewhere far away,

578
37:08.705 --> 37:10.985
so I'd never trouble you again?

579
37:12.065 --> 37:14.345
Wouldn't you have peace forever?

580
37:17.585 --> 37:19.145
I wasn't trying to help you.

581
37:20.385 --> 37:21.465
I just

582
37:23.665 --> 37:25.545
didn't want that vicious woman into my house.

583
37:28.265 --> 37:29.865
Since you've taken her place,

584
37:30.825 --> 37:32.265
then hold on to it.

585
37:33.065 --> 37:34.465
If you dare give up halfway,

586
37:35.185 --> 37:36.465
I'll be the first to make you pay.

587
37:40.865 --> 37:42.145
No matter what,

588
37:44.305 --> 37:45.825
you saved me, My Lord.

589
37:46.785 --> 37:47.825
That makes you my benefactor.

590
37:49.185 --> 37:51.185
Whatever reward you want,

591
37:51.945 --> 37:54.145
I won't refuse you anything.

592
38:04.145 --> 38:06.785
In the name of repayment, you seek to mend old ties with me.

593
38:08.465 --> 38:09.505
And if you're lucky,

594
38:10.905 --> 38:12.905
you'd bear my child and secure your life.

595
38:14.585 --> 38:16.225
Well, well, Wei Rao.

596
38:19.865 --> 38:21.705
Am I part of your next move too?

597
38:33.145 --> 38:34.265
Then you underestimate me.

598
38:36.585 --> 38:38.505
I don't want false affection.

599
38:52.865 --> 38:54.145
Forgive me for disturbing you.

600
38:55.625 --> 38:57.465
I've never met a woman like you.

601
38:58.225 --> 39:01.145
I can never tell when you're sincere and when you're pretending.

602
39:02.145 --> 39:03.825
I can never read your heart.

603
39:04.945 --> 39:06.105
Let me remind you.

604
39:09.625 --> 39:12.345
Sweet talk and false affection

605
39:13.385 --> 39:15.305
will never win you a sincere heart.

606
39:16.425 --> 39:19.665
Only those who live in comfort and without fear can afford sincerity.

607
39:20.945 --> 39:23.305
All I learned growing up was how to beg and survive.

608
39:24.305 --> 39:26.025
If you want my body,

609
39:26.105 --> 39:28.305
or a smile meant to please you, I can give you both.

610
39:28.905 --> 39:31.625
But don't ask me for something I can't give.

611
39:32.985 --> 39:34.425
A sincere heart is too precious.

612
39:35.905 --> 39:37.265
I don't have one to give.

613
40:02.585 --> 40:03.825
What are you doing?

614
40:08.585 --> 40:11.945
His Lordship ordered us to redeem all the jewelry you pawned.

615
40:12.025 --> 40:14.105
He also said that now you're a Noble Lady,

616
40:14.185 --> 40:16.345
you shouldn't dress too plainly.

617
40:16.425 --> 40:19.465
He had the storeroom opened so you can choose what you like tomorrow.

618
40:28.505 --> 40:31.665
Lu Zhuo. Why are you so good to me?

619
40:43.505 --> 40:46.025
Bitao, you're Noble Lady Wu'an's favorite now.

620
40:46.625 --> 40:49.585
I suppose you've forgotten how Madam once helped you.

621
40:50.305 --> 40:52.745
Her Ladyship will suspect something if she wakes and I'm gone.

622
40:52.825 --> 40:54.705
I don't have time for your nonsense.

623
40:54.785 --> 40:57.145
Madam told me to remind you

624
40:57.225 --> 40:58.985
to watch that woman's every move.

625
40:59.065 --> 41:02.905
If she does anything unusual, report it to Madam first.

626
41:03.545 --> 41:04.705
What exactly is Madam planning?

627
41:04.785 --> 41:06.665
That's none of your concern.

628
41:06.745 --> 41:08.785
Madam will give you orders when the time comes.

629
41:08.865 --> 41:11.145
If you slack off even a little,

630
41:11.225 --> 41:13.225
your whole family will pay with their lives.

631
41:20.865 --> 41:21.705
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

632
41:21.785 --> 41:23.345
My Lady.

633
41:23.425 --> 41:26.505
My Lady, please save us!

634
41:26.585 --> 41:27.985
My Lady!

635
41:28.065 --> 41:29.825
Please save us!

636
41:30.585 --> 41:32.025
-Steward, go see what's happening. -My Lady!

637
41:32.105 --> 41:33.905
-What's going on? -So many people kneeling outside.

638
41:33.985 --> 41:35.505
What's so alarming?

639
41:35.585 --> 41:37.425
-Let's go see. -Please save us!

640
41:37.505 --> 41:39.065
Please save us!

641
41:39.145 --> 41:42.105
-My Lady! -Go tell His Lordship. Hurry.

642
41:42.185 --> 41:43.865
Please save us!

643
41:45.385 --> 41:47.105
Please save us!

644
41:47.185 --> 41:48.225
‎My Lady!

645
41:48.305 --> 41:49.585
What's going on?

646
41:49.665 --> 41:51.025
-They're here to see Lady Lu, -Please save us!

647
41:51.105 --> 41:53.105
-No, to see Lady Wu'an. -Please save us!

648
41:53.185 --> 41:54.785
-Me? -Yes.

649
41:54.865 --> 41:56.665
Please save us!

650
41:56.745 --> 41:57.985
Please save us!

651
41:58.065 --> 41:59.305
My Lady!

652
41:59.385 --> 42:01.825
-Sir, please get up. -My Lady, please save us!

653
42:01.905 --> 42:05.865
My Lady, you kindly freed us from our contracts.

654
42:05.945 --> 42:07.625
Word has spread throughout the capital.

655
42:08.545 --> 42:11.865
At the foot of Mount Yaowang, over 300 farming families,

656
42:11.945 --> 42:15.225
more than 2000 people, have all benefited from your kindness.

657
42:15.865 --> 42:18.865
They all wish they could kneel here and thank you.

658
42:18.945 --> 42:20.465
But none of them can write,

659
42:21.145 --> 42:23.425
so they put their handprints on these bamboo slips.

660
42:24.105 --> 42:25.625
Every last one of them.

661
42:25.705 --> 42:27.465
They asked us to bring this to you.

662
42:28.345 --> 42:31.585
Please accept it, and take us under your protection.

663
42:33.065 --> 42:34.985
Yes, My Lady. Please take it.

664
42:35.065 --> 42:36.585
Please take it, My Lady.

665
42:37.105 --> 42:38.585
Please take it.

666
42:38.665 --> 42:40.465
They've all come to seek Noble Lady Wu'an's protection.

667
42:41.105 --> 42:42.865
Please, My Lady.

668
42:43.465 --> 42:46.265
Sir, I freed you so you could live as free people.

669
42:46.865 --> 42:49.425
I don't need tenant farmers, much less servants.

670
42:49.505 --> 42:50.665
Please, everyone, go home.

671
42:50.745 --> 42:52.985
-My Lady, please don't abandon us! -Please don't abandon us!

672
42:53.065 --> 42:56.105
-Please don't abandon us! -Please!

673
42:56.185 --> 42:58.545
-Please get up. I can't accept this. -I won't get up.

674
42:58.625 --> 42:59.945
Please get up.

675
43:00.025 --> 43:01.705
You freed them from the cruel Han family

676
43:01.785 --> 43:03.185
and made them free people.

677
43:03.705 --> 43:05.025
That was indeed an act of kindness.

678
43:05.865 --> 43:08.265
But the capital's nobles and powerful families

679
43:08.825 --> 43:10.585
see people and land as prizes to seize.

680
43:11.545 --> 43:12.865
Why would they let them go so easily?

681
43:12.945 --> 43:14.905
Once they lose their protector,

682
43:15.545 --> 43:17.625
they'll end up as something everyone fights over,

683
43:18.145 --> 43:19.345
and face an even worse fate.

684
43:19.425 --> 43:21.945
‎Is there really no other way, ‎Your Ladyship?

685
43:22.025 --> 43:22.985
Don't forget,

686
43:23.985 --> 43:25.425
Whenever a countryman rises in power,

687
43:26.025 --> 43:27.345
families of modest means

688
43:27.425 --> 43:28.825
hand over their land and homes,

689
43:28.905 --> 43:30.625
gladly becoming tenants and servants.

690
43:30.705 --> 43:33.345
All they want is to be safe.

691
43:34.145 --> 43:37.305
They all come to you because they chose you

692
43:41.025 --> 43:42.745
to be their true protector.

693
43:43.825 --> 43:46.825
My Lady, please… Please take us in!

694
43:46.905 --> 43:47.985
‎Please take us in!

695
43:48.065 --> 43:49.785
-Please take us in! -Please!

696
43:49.865 --> 43:51.705
-My Lady! -Please take us in!

697
43:51.785 --> 43:53.425
‎Take us in!

698
43:53.505 --> 43:56.705
-Take us in! -Please!

699
43:56.785 --> 43:59.305
Please take us in, My Lady.

700
43:59.385 --> 44:00.585
‎Take us in, My Lady.

701
44:00.665 --> 44:03.425
-Please don't abandon us. -Please take us in!

702
44:03.505 --> 44:04.465
‎Don't abandon us.

703
44:04.545 --> 44:05.665
I can't help you.

704
44:07.225 --> 44:08.625
Find someone else.

705
44:08.705 --> 44:13.265
-My Lady! -My Lady!

706
44:13.345 --> 44:15.225
-Please! -Please save us!

707
44:15.305 --> 44:17.185
-Please! -Look.

708
44:18.305 --> 44:19.905
Still just a sheltered woman.

709
44:19.985 --> 44:23.905
Even if I gave them to you for free, would you dare take them?

710
44:23.985 --> 44:26.305
My Lady!

711
44:26.385 --> 44:28.385
Please save us!

712
44:28.465 --> 44:29.905
My Lady!

713
44:29.985 --> 44:31.865
Please take us in!

714
44:31.945 --> 44:33.945
-Please save us! -My Lady!

715
44:34.025 --> 44:38.985
-We have nowhere else to turn! -Please save us!

716
44:43.105 --> 44:46.105
Please have mercy, My Lady!

717
44:46.185 --> 44:49.145
Please save us!

718
44:52.705 --> 44:55.225
Please take us in!

719
44:57.425 --> 45:00.145
All right. You have my word.

720
45:02.865 --> 45:05.905
My Lady will be our protector from now on!

721
45:05.985 --> 45:07.545
My Lady is our protector!

722
45:07.625 --> 45:08.625
Please, get up.

723
45:09.425 --> 45:10.745
Thank you, My Lady!

724
45:16.585 --> 45:17.425
Let's go!

725
45:19.465 --> 45:20.945
My Lady is truly kind!

726
45:21.025 --> 45:23.625
We have someone to protect us now!

727
45:38.825 --> 45:40.465
Why did you suddenly change your mind?

728
45:45.385 --> 45:46.585
I refused

729
45:47.265 --> 45:48.825
because I can barely protect myself.

730
45:49.705 --> 45:51.265
I couldn't protect them.

731
45:54.025 --> 45:55.545
But then I realized something.

732
45:56.785 --> 45:57.825
We make our own fate.

733
45:58.465 --> 45:59.705
"We make our own fate"?

734
46:00.745 --> 46:01.985
What do you mean?

735
46:02.065 --> 46:03.985
I've seen it myself in the Lu family.

736
46:04.985 --> 46:07.465
Every great noble house has its own retainers.

737
46:08.265 --> 46:11.985
So a Noble Lady appointed by the Emperor can certainly have them too.

738
46:13.585 --> 46:14.425
What are you planning?

739
46:16.305 --> 46:18.465
I'll train the young and able into my own guards

740
46:18.545 --> 46:19.385
to protect me.

741
46:21.025 --> 46:23.985
As long as I live another day, I can protect them for another day.

742
46:24.945 --> 46:27.705
Every region needs officials to govern it.

743
46:28.385 --> 46:31.145
Rather than let corrupt officials hold power and make the people suffer,

744
46:32.025 --> 46:33.505
I would rather take that position myself.

745
46:34.425 --> 46:35.465
I know I can do

746
46:36.985 --> 46:38.905
better than any of them.

747
46:40.585 --> 46:42.185
No one ever taught you this,

748
46:43.385 --> 46:44.825
yet you figured it out on your own.

749
46:47.625 --> 46:48.865
You truly are clever.

750
47:13.385 --> 47:14.225
Watch your step.

751
47:30.385 --> 47:32.385
My Lord, My Lady, the Empress Dowager summons you.

752
47:49.025 --> 47:51.305
Wei Rao. Do you know your crime?

753
47:52.185 --> 47:54.345
The Empress Dowager must have a reason for summoning us privately.

754
47:54.985 --> 47:56.185
I fear Han Liao

755
47:57.105 --> 47:58.545
has already accused you before Her Majesty.

756
47:59.585 --> 48:01.945
You mean the Empress Dowager knows who I really am?

757
48:03.865 --> 48:05.385
Will you confess or not?

758
48:07.745 --> 48:10.825
I confess my guilt. I deserve death!

759
48:10.905 --> 48:12.145
Good.

760
48:13.585 --> 48:15.665
Confess your crime honestly,

761
48:16.665 --> 48:17.785
and name the mastermind.

762
48:18.785 --> 48:21.785
I may show mercy and spare your life.

763
50:41.585 --> 50:44.585
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED ‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
